# The GameCove commit whose builders, tests and data these workflows run. Every workflow checks it out read-only
# (no token kept) and runs only what that exact commit contains, so a change to a builder reaches the published
# files only through a reviewed bump of this file. Bump it after a GameCove change to gamedb/, tools/upscalers/,
# tools/device_photos/, app/data/devices.json, app/data/device_photos.json, packaging/helpers/ or the cosign pins in
# packaging/get-gamecove.sh (see README.md, "Updating").
GAMECOVE_REPO=IHulkSmashI/GameCove
GAMECOVE_COMMIT=cfa211657a984ae59be454965318fb9272eaa5f2
